      },
      "reason": "The input is an API token or transient viewer identity used only as a bounded in-memory retention counter key, not a stored administrator password or an authentication verifier. Retention sessions expire and only site-level completion events are persisted. Administrator password storage and verification use bcrypt. The review does not claim that an unkeyed digest provides anonymization of low-entropy credentials.",
